                       "description":  "All data-heavy panels (Events, API Requests, MCP Calls, Playwright Results, AWAS Steps, Process Session Output) use backend-driven pagination to prevent webview OOM crashes. Large datasets (240K+ rows, 48MB+) must never be loaded in full. Each panel initially loads a limited page of results and provides a \u0027Show more\u0027 mechanism to load additional pages on demand. The backend enforces LIMIT/OFFSET at the SQL level for unfiltered queries, capping IPC payload size at ~200 items by default.",
